:false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":1941456,"digest":"sha256:886cc041c00664f15611b74aa08bf9547c2f1347087ec541ac6f3205bb162557","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-06-15T00:58:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T00:58:36Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/source.tar.gz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/releases/assets/447687065","id":447687065,"node_id":"RA_kwDOGc0B384arymZ","name":"source.tar.gz.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":81,"digest":"sha256:177059b8b0a178fb935209f3aabd3226611fe520b8c6b7268fb46ebde65ad377","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-06-15T00:58:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T00:58:36Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/source.tar.gz.sha256"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/tarball/v2.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/zipball/v2.2.0","body":"## Release Notes\n\n### 📚 Documentation\n\n- Align v2 docs with actual implementation (#937)\n- Add Examples showcase, and make the examples runnable (#939)\n- Replace dead mainnet relay in v2 docs and CONTRIBUTING (#940)\n- Add per-example READMEs and slim the examples showcase (#943)\n- Correct opt-in build notes for kafka and mithril (#945)\n- Make cloud-sink examples runnable standalone via docker-compose (#947)\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Remove the broken pool_metadata example (#941)\n- Slim dependencies and ship a batteries-included default binary (#944)\n- Update cargo-dist, drop self-updater and PR release dry-run (#946)\n\n## Install oura 2.2.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install txpipe/tap/oura\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project\n\n```sh\nnpm install @txpipe/oura@2.2.0\n```\n\n## Download oura 2.2.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [oura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [oura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [oura-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [oura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.2.0/oura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/releases/339077602","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/releases/339077602/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/releases/339077602/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/tag/v2.1.0","id":339077602,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOGc0B384UNeni","tag_name"