,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/source.tar.gz.sha256"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/tarball/v2.0.0-beta.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/zipball/v2.0.0-beta.0","body":"## Release Notes\n\n<a name=\"v1.8.1\"></a>\n\n## Install oura 2.0.0-beta.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install txpipe/tap/oura\n```\n\n## Download oura 2.0.0-beta.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [oura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [oura-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [oura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [oura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/txpipe/oura/releases/download/v2.0.0-beta.0/oura-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/releases/204739454","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/txpipe/oura/releases/204739454/assets","upload_url":"https:/